# grid-tdse

##
Library for solving the N-body TDSE 

$$
i \partial_t \Psi(\mathbf{r}_1, \cdots, \mathbf{r}_N; t) = \hat{H}(t) \Psi(\mathbf{r}_1, \cdots, \mathbf{r}_N; t),
$$

by direct discretization of the wavefunction for few-body systems ($N=1,2$). 
